M-Lab NDT7 Client for HarmonyOS (ndt7-ohos)
Copyright 2026 Quoc Bui and ndt7-ohos contributors

This product includes software developed as an open source client implementation
of the Measurement Lab (M-Lab) Network Diagnostic Tool (NDT7) protocol.

M-Lab NDT7 Protocol Specification and Reference Implementations:
- Protocol Specification: https://github.com/m-lab/ndt-server/blob/main/spec/ndt7-protocol.md
- Official JavaScript Client: https://github.com/m-lab/ndt7-js
- Official Go Client: https://github.com/m-lab/ndt7-client-go

